    "totalDuration": "5 yrs 4 mos",
    "description": "Online Shopping mall project is a web application built for managing facilities like booking movie tickets, parking slots, product purchases, and payment gateway. It’s a web application running on the AWS, following Model view controller (MVC) architecture and using maven as a build tool.\n•\tExperience with all phases of SDLC including requirement gathering requirements, analysis of the customer specifications and customization as well as the development of applications. \n•\tFor the purpose of dependency injection used XML Configuration and Spring Annotations. \n•\tHands-on practice on WebLogic/Jboss server migration process that includes development to staging and staging to production. \n•\tMaintained and changed code related to JBoss and used GIT for configurations. \n•\tDeveloped SQL queries for data modification and providing connections by using Spring and Hibernate to the databases. \n•\tExperience in developing fully automated continuous integration system using custom tools developed in Python. \n•\tDeveloped unit test cases using Junit and used Maven and Gradle for project building. \n•\tRegulated server instance on the AWS infrastructure using Chef configuration management Identity Access Management (IAM) and provided user access management for deserving users. \n•\tExperience in developing Python/Django-based web applications.",
